sequenceDiagram
title Login with Token

box rgba(173, 216, 230, 0.5) Client
participant Client
end

box rgba(144, 238, 144, 0.5) Server
participant Server
end

box rgba(255, 228, 181, 0.5) BBDD
participant BBDD
end

Client->>Server: Request HTTPS POST (username/password)
Server-->>BBDD: Generate Token for user and store in User table
Server-->>Client: Login OK + Token (JSON)

Client->>Server: Request /child (Token UserA)
Server->>BBDD: Validate TokenUserA
Server->>Client: Return child info (JSON)

Client->>Server: Request /child (Token UserB)
Server->>BBDD: TokenUserB not found
Server->>Client: Error: Authenticated Service